,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":886.037851562,"data":"Okay, so I have this problem about a right square pyramid with a volume of 54 and a base side length of 6. All five vertices lie on a sphere, and I need to find the radius of that sphere, expressed as a reduced fraction m/n, then find m + n.\n"}
