,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":886.037859022,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":886.037861313,"data":"The volume of a pyramid is given by (1/3) * base area * height. The base area is 6*6 = 36. The volume is 54, so I can set up the equation:\n"}
